# The blank (or none) between two neighbouring tokens that no other rule decides (syntax:
# crates/core-format/src/spacing.rs); the first row that matches decides, the last row says yes.
[space]
* / text=)|]|,|;|.|?.|::|->|.. : no
* / text=++|--&parent=PostIncrementExpression|PostDecrementExpression : no
# `[.. items]`
text=..&parent=SpreadElement / * : yes
text=(|[|.|?.|::|->|~|.. / * : no
text=,|; / * : yes
# `operator ==(`
parent=OperatorDeclaration / text=( : no
# Words that take a blank before an opening parenthesis or bracket (`if (`, `return (`, `var (`).
exact=if|while|for|foreach|switch|lock|using|catch|fixed|when|return|throw|await|in|is|and|or|not|case|yield|else|do|var|delegate|select|where|equals|by|on|group|orderby|let|from|join|into|ref|out|with|async|static / text=(|[ : yes
ends=word / text=(&parent=TupleType : yes
ends=word / text=(|[ : no
text=)|]|>|!|? / text=(|[ : no
* / text=(|[ : yes
* / text=<&parent=TypeArgumentList|TypeParameterList|FunctionPointerParameterList : no
* / text=:&parent=BaseList|TypeParameterConstraintClause|BaseConstructorInitializer|ThisConstructorInitializer : yes
* / text=: : no
* / text=?&parent=NullableType|ClassConstraint|StructConstraint : no
* / text=? : yes
* / text=*&parent=PointerType|FunctionPointerType : no
text=)&parent=CastExpression / * : no
* / * : yes
